    # Format ports for echo: tcp first, then U, S, I
    # Each proto's ports are sorted and merged into ranges, formatted as "80,8000-8100" etc.
    # For tcp (no prefix), just numbers. For others, prefix + numbers.
    # If no ports at all, return "" (empty after "ports = ")
